---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Support — Bomray Lab"
  description="Support for Needs Attention for Jira."
>
  <main class="container">
    <article class="document">
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="meta">Support for Needs Attention for Jira</p>

      <p>Need help, found a bug, or have a question about a scan result? Contact Bomray Lab by email.</p>

      <div class="contact-box">
        <strong>Email support</strong><br>
        <a href="mailto:bomray.lab@gmail.com?subject=Needs%20Attention%20for%20Jira%20Support">bomray.lab@gmail.com</a>
      </div>

      <h2>When contacting support</h2>
      <p>Please include the following where possible:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your Jira Cloud site URL</li>
        <li>The screen or feature involved</li>
        <li>Steps to reproduce the issue</li>
        <li>A screenshot with sensitive information removed</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Response time</h2>
      <p>We aim to respond to support requests within three business days. Response times may vary for weekends, public holidays, or issues that require investigation with Atlassian.</p>

      <h2>Security issues</h2>
      <p>For suspected security vulnerabilities, use the subject line <strong>Security Report</strong> and avoid including confidential Jira data in the first email.</p>

      <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
      <p>For information about data handling, see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
